{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.markov_eq_mobius_contact","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.markov_eq_mobius_contact","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/JonesMobiusDiagonal.lean#L66-L77","doc":"**Lemma (Jones polynomial = Möbius contact term).**\nThe fundamental Jones polynomial (Markov trace) is exactly the diagonal\nself-energy subtracted by the Möbius renormalization:\n`J_K = twoPointReg − E_cat`.  The fundamental Jones data therefore embeds\ninto the Möbius two-point data as its contact / diagonal term; the converse\nmap loses the off-diagonal fusion content `Δ(e_λ) = Σ N^λ_{μν} e_μ ⊗ e_ν`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:jones-mobius-diagonal","label":"lem:jones-mobius-diagonal","md":"quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/jones-mobius-diagonal.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.renormalization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.renormalization","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/JonesMobiusDiagonal.lean#L60-L60","doc":"**(Renormalization).** The Möbius energy is the regularized two-point\nvalue minus the diagonal contact (Hadamard finite part). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.contact_is_markov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.contact_is_markov","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/JonesMobiusDiagonal.lean#L57-L57","doc":"**(Diagonal = Jones).** The kernel's contact coefficient is the\nfundamental Markov trace — the coincidence restriction of\n`lem:mobius-energy-frobenius-kernel`, identified via\n`thm:jones-markov-trace`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.twoPointReg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.twoPointReg","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/JonesMobiusDiagonal.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Regularized two-point value: the full kernel integral over\n`S¹ × S¹ ∖ diag` with the universal singular part removed (finite part). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.mobiusEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.mobiusEnergy","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/JonesMobiusDiagonal.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Off-diagonal (renormalized) categorical Möbius energy `E_cat(ϱ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.contact","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.contact","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/JonesMobiusDiagonal.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Diagonal contact coefficient of the categorical Möbius kernel\n`tr(Δ(ϱ(s)) ⊗ Δ(ϱ(t)))` — the regularized residue on `s = t`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.markovTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.markovTrace","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/JonesMobiusDiagonal.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Fundamental ($N = 2$) Markov trace `tr_M(ρ(β_K))`; its value is the Jones\npolynomial `J_K`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/JonesMobiusDiagonal.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.JonesMobiusDiagonal","kind":"class","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/JonesMobiusDiagonal.lean#L39-L60","doc":"Abstract data for the Jones–Möbius diagonal identity over a base ring `R`.\n`R` is generic (the renormalization is an additive identity, §7c). ","signatureChunk":0}]}